   * This operation performs a complete update of the todo item with all provided values. The system must:
   *
   * 1. Validate the todo exists and belongs to the authenticated user
   * 2. Validate all input data (title length, description length, date formats)
   * 3. Update the specified fields with new values
   * 4. Create an edit history entry documenting the changes
   * 5. Update the updated_at timestamp
   * 6. Return the complete updated todo item
   *
   * Edge cases to handle:
   * - Todo not found or not owned by user (404/403 errors)
   * - Validation errors for invalid input data
   * - Date validation (start date before due date)
