   * 2. Validate required title field (non-empty, max 200 chars)
   * 3. Validate optional description (max 5000 chars)
   * 4. Validate optional start_date and due_date (ISO 8601 format)
   * 5. Enforce business rule: due_date must not be earlier than start_date if both provided
   * 6. Set is_completed to false by default
   * 7. Set created_at and updated_at to current timestamp
   * 8. Insert record into database
   * 9. Return created todo with all fields including id and timestamps
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
